    <http://example.org/node/chunk170> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium proposes an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution designed specifically for the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB). an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution designed specifically for the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) aims to improve the efficiency of staff and the quality and safety of patient care by providing an intelligent assistance tool that supports hospital staff in hospital staff clinical-administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool that supports hospital staff in their clinical-administrative activities will facilitate access to information, improve the quality of written outputs, and reduce processing and documentation times. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution designed specifically for the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) is based on Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities, which combine natural language processing and information retrieval to provide accurate and context-specific responses. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution designed specifically for the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will be hosted on OuraneCloud's SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure, ensuring compliance with French regulations regarding health data hosting and sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

