    <http://example.org/node/chunk172> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed architecture utilizes OuraneCloud's platform with RAG capabilities, deploying The proposed architecture on the Sovereign HDS tier of OuraneCloud's's qualification and EU location. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution designed specifically for the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) integrates with the hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI) through API-first design, using standard connectors or custom adapters as necessary. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution designed specifically for the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) provides drafting assistance for clinical and administrative content, such as discharge summaries and medical reports, ensuring that generated content is adapted to the clinical-administrative context and conforms to expected quality standards. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution designed specifically for the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) supports medical coding (PMSI/ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A) and takes into account dossier context where available." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk173> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "OuraneCloud's ensure that no clinical or medico-administrative decision is automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional, aligning with the regulatory requirements of not requiring medical device qualification (CE marking/MDR). an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution designed specifically for the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) provides explanations for an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution designed specifically for the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) outputs, allowing users to understand the reasoning behind recommendations or suggestions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

