    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, I have identified key risks and opportunities for our in The tender.  the key risks and opportunities for our company in this tender include leveraging our past public sector references, such as the regional council and mutual health insurer projects, to demonstrate our expertise in implementing AI assistance solutions in similar contexts. our consortium partners, including OuraneCloud and Ligeo Santé, can provide valuable support in areas like sovereign cloud hosting and health-IT integration, which are crucial for this project. our hybrid delivery model, combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure, is well-suited for public sector procurement and can help our manage the pilot phase and progressive rollout effectively. our available capacity, including a dedicated team with a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, can ensure that our have the necessary resources to deliver this project." ;
